# Open Questions

Purpose:
- track unresolved questions that affect architecture, product behavior, operations, or agent workflow
- keep uncertainty visible without blocking unrelated work

Rules:
- Close questions by moving the answer into the right knowledge file.
- Link the closing decision, task, PR, or note.
- Remove questions only when the answer is captured elsewhere.

## Question Template

